      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The basics",
        "heading": "Use it daily,\ncare for it simply",
        "text": "<p><strong>Dishwasher &amp; microwave safe.</strong> Every piece is twice vitrified at 2,200&deg;F, so it handles the dishwasher, microwave, and a hot oven without a second thought. Avoid direct flame and sudden temperature shocks.</p><p><strong>Lead-free &amp; food-safe.</strong> We use only lead-free, food-safe clay and glazes, fired to food-safe certification standards on every batch.</p><p><strong>If it chips, we'll take it back.</strong> Pieces marked with a small glaze chip at the base are sold as seconds at a discount. Everything else is covered by our lifetime replacement promise for manufacturing defects.</p>",
